      "text": "Trigger The sard is about to damage a creature that has electricity resistance\n\n---\n\nEffect An instant before the target takes the electricity damage from the triggering event, the sard's electrical sparks glow red. The target must succeed at a DC 41 Will save save or lose any electricity resistance it has until this curse is lifted."
